Get pMax value
    [Documentation]   Get value of pMax parameter from configuration and return it as dictionary containing dictionary
    ...   and integer value.
    ...   :param cell_id:  if given verify one specific cell, else verify random cell
    ...   :param bts_id:  BTS(eNB/gNB) id - related to Test Line configuration
    ...   :param du_id: DU id(Distributed Unit) - id related to Test Line configuration - gnb.dus[]
    ...   :return: {"dict": {'MRBTS-10297/NRBTS-297/NRCELL-1': {
    ...                            'pMax': param_value
    ...                            }}, "value": 190}
    ...            dict is used as input to keyword Verify gNB Configuration Parameters Have Expected Values
    ...            and value is pMax parameter value
    [Arguments]   ${cell_id}=${None}     ${gnb_id}=${0}    ${du_id}=${0}
    ${return_value}    gnbcell.get_pmax_value   cell_id=${cell_id}   bts_id=${gnb_id}    du_id=${du_id}
    [Return]   ${return_value}

